<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <!-- Slime_Rename.xml            RimUtinni Patches — new file 2026-09-24

       NONCANON_BEAST_RENAME_1 batch 3d — the Slime. Owner ruled batch 3
       applied 2026-09-24 (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/
       noncanon_beast_names_crags_nightside_contagion_slime.md). Eleven donor
       ThingDef+PawnKindDef pairs (9 Alpha Animals AA_, 2 Vanilla Genetics
       Expanded GR_) get a label/description patch, on the
       PatchOperationConditional gate pattern of RotSpecies_NamesAndSizes.xml.
       Slime-law monosyllables (owner ruling 2026-09-24, rule 8) on the
       gel-bodied residents: wuum, oomb (+greater/lesser), bezzul... no,
       bezzul is a snail not a slime — see the source doc's rule 8 note.

       LABEL ONLY on the identity; no defName, stat, or art field is touched.

       Not drafted here: AA_Helixien (bileworm, Contagion batch — a slug, not
       a slime, rule 8 does not take it). RM_Titanoslime — the doc records
       this only as an OFFER ("if he wants it... otherwise it stands"), not a
       ruling; left untouched pending his word. -->








  <!-- ============== GR_Chickenrabbit -> wuppik ============== -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="GR_Chickenrabbit"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="GR_Chickenrabbit"]/label</xpath>
          <value><label>wuppik</label></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="GR_Chickenrabbit"]/description</xpath>
          <value><description>A small, soft, harmless hybrid that breeds faster than almost anything else in the Slime and slips away to the wild given half a chance. The wuppik is the one genuinely funny thing this biome grows.</description></value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="GR_Chickenrabbit"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
      <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="GR_Chickenrabbit"]/label</xpath>
      <value><label>wuppik</label></value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

  <!-- ============== GR_Manbear -> yollum ============== -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="GR_Manbear"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="GR_Manbear"]/label</xpath>
          <value><label>yollum</label></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="GR_Manbear"]/description</xpath>
          <value><description>A round, waist-high shape that talks like a person and looks, at a glance, almost cuddly. It is useless in a fight and knows it, but a yollum can talk a prisoner into joining the colony faster than anyone would expect from something built like a stuffed toy.</description></value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="GR_Manbear"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
      <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="GR_Manbear"]/label</xpath>
      <value><label>yollum</label></value>
    </match>
  </Operation>



</Patch>
